{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-1-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-1","refs":["F-panel-201","F-panel-225","F-panel-217","F-panel-221","F-panel-218"],"severity":"S4","title":"In Hinglish, Visits, Enquiries, Expenses, Import, Help, Gym timings, Diet plans, Measurements and most of the member page stay in English","what":"An owner who picks Hinglish sees the menu say 'Hazri' and 'Hisaab', but the pages behind them are almost all English: the Visits page has 2 translated lines out of about 80, Expenses, Import members, Help and feedback and Measurements have none. On the member page only the pass-company lines are in Hinglish, so one button can say 'Checked in for today.' in English while the pass line next to it is Hinglish. Challenges is the only page in this group that is fully in Hinglish.","expected":"Either these pages read in Hinglish too, or the language switch says which pages it covers so the owner is not surprised by half-English screens.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Attendance.tsx:130","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Attendance.tsx:137","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/MemberDetail.tsx:336","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Expenses.tsx:84","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/ImportMembers.tsx:516","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Feedback.tsx:64","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/MemberMeasurements.tsx:34","apps/dashboard/src/crm/lang/hinglish.ts:12"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"hinglish-scope-first-day-screens-only","who":"owners who use Hinglish","how_often":"every time","fix_line":"Wrap these pages' words for Hinglish, member page first, and have him read the new lines aloud before release","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-1-02","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-1","refs":["F-panel-239","F-panel-526"],"severity":"S4","title":"Measurements tells the owner members find them under Progress, Body, but the member app has no Progress tab any more","what":"Under a member's body measurements, and in the measure form, the admin app says members see them in the MettleUp app under 'Progress, Body'. The member app now has three tabs, Workout, Gym and Profile; Body sits under Profile, in the 'Your progress' list. An owner who tells a member 'open Progress' sends them looking for a tab that is not there.","expected":"The line names the real place: Profile, then Body.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/MemberMeasurements.tsx:34","apps/mobile/src/lib/appTabs.ts:15-19","apps/mobile/src/app/(tabs)/profile.tsx:471"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"stale-member-app-path-words","who":"owners and desk staff","how_often":"every time","fix_line":"Change the line to say Profile, then Body","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-1-03","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-1","refs":["F-panel-233","F-panel-209","F-panel-220","F-panel-206"],"severity":"S4","title":"Four buttons go grey with no word saying why","what":"'Cancel membership' stays grey until the reason box has at least 3 letters, but the sheet only says the reason is saved with the membership, not that it is needed. '+ Add a meal' on a diet plan goes grey at 10 meals, '+ Add a special day' on Gym timings at 30 days, and 'Add a machine' on Busy machines at 30 machines, each with nothing on screen about the limit.","expected":"Next to each grey button a short line says why: 'Type a reason (3 letters or more) to cancel', 'A plan can have at most 10 meals', and so on.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/MemberDetail.tsx:944","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/MemberDetail.tsx:962","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/DietPlans.tsx:458","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/dietPlans.ts:50","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/GymTimings.tsx:329","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/BusyMachines.tsx:270"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"grey-button-no-reason-shown","who":"owners and desk staff","how_often":"sometimes","fix_line":"Add one short line under each of these buttons saying what is needed or what the limit is","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-panel-screens-1-04","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-10","surface":"panel","area":"panel/screens-1","refs":["F-panel-209","F-panel-205"],"severity":"S4","title":"Two buttons with long words can run past the edge of a phone screen","what":"On the diet plan form the button 'Add \u201cTalk to a doctor if you have a health condition.\u201d' is about 55 letters on one line that is never allowed to wrap, so on a 320 to 390 px phone it is wider than the screen. After thanking a member for bringing a friend, the sheet's button reads 'Open' plus the friend's full name, also on one unbreakable line, so a long name pushes it off the edge.","expected":"Both buttons wrap onto two lines or use short words, for example 'Add the doctor line' and 'Open member'.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/DietPlans.tsx:485","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/dietPlans.ts:61","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Enquiries.tsx:1038","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/Enquiries.tsx:1042","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/kit.tsx:478-480"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"long-button-text-no-wrap","who":"owners and desk on a phone","how_often":"sometimes","fix_line":"Let these two buttons wrap, or shorten their words","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
